{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14219080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14219080","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1421908001:1":{"text":"深受神明之眷……这指的是赫托与矮人关系最亲密的那段时光吧。","source_cn":"深受神明之眷……这指的是赫托与矮人关系最亲密的那段时光吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE389202A9E390BB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421908002:1":{"text":"那时的矮人一族刚掌握了锻造技艺与魔力，正是意气风发、见证伟大帝国一点点建立的时候……","source_cn":"那时的矮人一族刚掌握了锻造技艺与魔力，正是意气风发、见...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1241EFF85344C4B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421908003:1":{"text":"描述这段历史的史料极为稀少，这块石碑可以作为我们了解钢心帝国早期历史的重要文物！","source_cn":"描述这段历史的史料极为稀少，这块石碑可以作为我们了解钢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE0C7F08AC18B5D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421908004:1":{"text":"我更在意的是后面的句子，矮人于此作祝日……祭以矮人珍重物……是什么意思呢？","source_cn":"我更在意的是后面的句子，矮人于此作祝日……祭以矮人珍重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8778A1D67D595410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1421908004":{"text":"我更在意的是后面的句子，矮人于此作祝日……祭以矮人珍重物……是什么意思呢？","source_cn":"我更在意的是后面的句子，矮人于此作祝日……祭以矮人珍重物……是什么意思呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8778A1D67D595410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421908005:1":{"text":"我想想……这难道是传说中的锻魂祭？！矮人为了感念赫托的馈赠，会在锻魂祭上献上自己最珍爱的东西，一般是自己最满意的作品，比如武器之类的……","source_cn":"我想想……这难道是传说中的锻魂祭？！矮人为了感念赫托的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00BCE8F299B0DE27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421908006:1":{"text":"锻魂祭后来慢慢演变成了现在一年一度的锻魂大赛！只是现在的年轻矮人大多不知道它的来历了……","source_cn":"锻魂祭后来慢慢演变成了现在一年一度的锻魂大赛！只是现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46957AAD0C108A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421908007:1":{"text":"俺小时候好像听过，是有个古老的祭典会让矮人献上珍贵的宝物……当时俺还问长辈，神明怎么用得了这么多好东西……","source_cn":"俺小时候好像听过，是有个古老的祭典会让矮人献上珍贵的宝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D9DD708202CA95B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421908008:1":{"text":"锻魂祭仪式比起“献予”，更像是“展示”或“认证”……祭典结束后这些被认证的珍贵之物自然会回到矮人手上！","source_cn":"锻魂祭仪式比起“献予”，更像是“展示”或“认证”……祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA777F552E21BE8F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421908009:1":{"text":"奉以熔岩水，奉以锻造晶，魔力荡涤古碑尘，矮人匠心始显形……这段碑文的后半部分似乎是在讲使什么东西显形的方法？","source_cn":"奉以熔岩水，奉以锻造晶，魔力荡涤古碑尘，矮人匠心始显形...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3FADE4186433889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1421908009":{"text":"奉以熔岩水，奉以锻造晶，魔力荡涤古碑尘，矮人匠心始显形……这段碑文的后半部分似乎是在讲使什么东西显形的方法？","source_cn":"奉以熔岩水，奉以锻造晶，魔力荡涤古碑尘，矮人匠心始显形……这段碑文的后半部分似乎是在讲使什么东西显形的方法？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3FADE4186433889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421908010:1":{"text":"……！什么！你们是说俺先祖给俺留了宝物？照着这上面说的俺就能找到它？","source_cn":"……！什么！你们是说俺先祖给俺留了宝物？照着这上面说的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x349E7917F99871B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421908011:1":{"text":"很有可能是这样……那“熔岩水”和“锻造晶”又是指什么呢？","source_cn":"很有可能是这样……那“熔岩水”和“锻造晶”又是指什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x026EBB615E8ACF1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421908012:1":{"text":"这还不简单！你们这些考古什么家也太孬了，不就是指岩浆和矿石嘛。","source_cn":"这还不简单！你们这些考古什么家也太孬了，不就是指岩浆和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48604B8B8D75200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421908013:1":{"text":"以矮人的思维来说，确实是指这两样东西！毕竟传说中赫托以火山为炉，锻矿石为铁，向矮人揭示了锻造技艺的奥秘……德鲁，这次你可说对了！","source_cn":"以矮人的思维来说，确实是指这两样东西！毕竟传说中赫托以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2